        <p style="margin-top:14px">Vision plans are built around an annual eye exam plus an allowance toward glasses or contacts, which keeps your out of pocket cost predictable.</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li><strong>Annual eye exam.</strong> A comprehensive exam each year for a low copay, which also screens for eye health issues.</li>
          <li><strong>Lenses.</strong> Single vision, bifocal, and progressive lenses covered each benefit period.</li>
          <li><strong>Frames.</strong> An allowance toward frames, with any extra cost paid by you.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact lenses.</strong> An allowance toward contacts in place of glasses, plus discounts on LASIK with many carriers.</li>
        </ul>
